        <briefdescription>
<para>Get a register bank that covers <computeroutput>RC</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="pre"><para><computeroutput>RC</computeroutput> is a user-defined register class (as opposed as one generated by <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_table_gen" kindref="compound">TableGen</ref>).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The mapping RC -&gt; RegBank could be built while adding the coverage for the register banks. However, we do not do it, because, at least for now, we only need this information for register classes that are used in the description of instruction. In other words, there are just a handful of them and we do not want to waste space.</para>
</simplesect>
<xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000003"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This should be <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_table_gen" kindref="compound">TableGen</ref>&apos;ed. </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
        </detaileddescription>
